<div class="text-center">
    <h1 class="display-4">Guarded Goods</h1>
    <h3>Guarded Goods is a secure marketplace where verified users can buy and sell dry, non-food goods weighing 50 pounds or less. It targets college students under 30 seeking a convenient and reliable shopping experience. Sellers can offer free shipping or require buyers to pay shipping costs. The platform helps reduce the risks associated with unreliable sellers and traditional purchasing methods.</h3>
